[5805]="7004E749\n1\tDefeat Thruglok, the mining overseer\tFind and defeat Thruglok, the mining overseer.\n2\tFind and defeat Gast and Nûl, leaders of the mine\tFind and defeat Gast and Nûl, the chiefs of the Gundabad mining operation.\n",
[5806]="700509C5\n1\tDefeat invaders within Glimmerdeep (total: 20)\tDefeat invaders within Glimmerdeep.\n2\tCompleted\tDefeat invaders within Glimmerdeep.\n",
[5807]="700509C8\n1\tDefeat Blogdob\tDefeat Blogdob within Glimmerdeep.\n2\tTalk to Stráhek the Stout\tYou should return to to Stráhek the Stout in Skarháld and let him know of your victory at Glimmerdeep.\n",
[5808]="700509C9\n1\tGather rare gemstones (total: 8)\tGather rare gemstones.\n2\tCompleted\tGather rare gemstones.\n",
[5809]="7004E491\n1\tThe rivers of the Ironfold can be found flowing from the Iron Hills. Kári hopes to impress Foreman Brumbur by proving that panning the rivers of the Iron Hills might prove a substantial source of iron and other minerals.\t\n2\tDeliver the glimmering fragments to Kári in Járnfast\tKári can be found among the ruined mines of Járnfast. After panning in the rivers and streams of the Iron Hills, you have collected a small amount of glimmering fragments. You should deliver them to Kári in Járnfast.\n",
[5810]="70047BD9\n1\tDefeat marsh-lights in the southern Dead Marshes (total: 12)\tMarsh-lights can be found in northern Dagorlad in the southern reaches of the Dead Marshes. You have come across a number of aggressive and distracting marsh-lights in the Dead Marshes. You should quiet them before leaving the area.\n2\tCompleted\tYou have defeated many marsh-lights in the southern reaches of the Dead Marshes.\n",
[5811]="7000A8D4\n1\tDefeat Nengon\tNengon and his darkwater brethren are within the pools and gardens of Glinghant, beyond the court of Clorhir. Harthadril has asked that you enter Glinghant and defeat the darkwater that have despoiled its beauty.\n",
[5812]="70029B2B\n1\tTalk to Bron to travel to the Dunbog\tBron is in Galtrev. You should speak with Bron to begin your fishing expedition in the Dunbog. NOTE: You must have the fishing hobby trained in order to complete this quest. NOTE: This is a solo quest and cannot be completed in a fellowship.\n2\tTalk to Bron in Galtrev\tBron is in Galtrev at the milestone marker in the centre of town. You should speak with Bron to collect your reward.\n",
[5813]="7005F6B6\n1\tDefeat glass-spiders in Glittengrof\tGlass-spiders can be found in Glittengrof in Gloomingtarn. While exploring Glittengrof, you have encountered an invasive swarm of glass-spiders dwelling among the ancient crystal-lodes of Mount Gundabad. You should defeat glass-spiders in Glittengrof.\n2\tDefeat glass-spiders in Glittengrof (total: 16)\tGlass-spiders can be found in Glittengrof in Gloomingtarn. While exploring Glittengrof, you have encountered an invasive swarm of glass-spiders dwelling among the ancient crystal-lodes of Mount Gundabad. You should defeat glass-spiders in Glittengrof.\n3\tCompleted\tYou have defeated many of the invasive glass-spiders in Glittengrof.\n",
[5814]="70052CE7\n1\tDefeat wandering glooms (total: 10)\tWandering glooms can be found along the river Gladden. You should defeat wandering glooms.\n2\tCompleted\tDefeated many wandering glooms.\n",
[5815]="7005A746\n1\tDefeat Drôk-and-Kharb\tDefeat Drôk-and-Kharb.\n2\tTalk to Zádokh Flint-eye\tYou should return to Zádokh Flint-eye and apprise him of your efforts.\n",
[5816]="7005A73B\n1\tCollect flint (total: 10)\tCollect flint.\n",
[5817]="7005A73A\n1\tDefeat trolls (total: 15)\tDefeat trolls.\n",
[5818]="7004D372\n1\tDefeat Gloomthorn\tGloomthorn can be found patrolling Eryn Lasgalen. You have encountered the vile Gloomthorn. Roaming the Mirkwood, the corrupted Huorn lurks amongst the trees.\n2\tDefeat Gloomthorn\tGloomthorn can be found patrolling Eryn Lasgalen. You have encountered the vile Gloomthorn. Roaming the Mirkwood, the corrupted Huorn lurks amongst the trees.\n3\tCompleted\tYou have defeated Gloomthorn.\n",
[5819]="70009F56\n1\tTalk to Culang\tCulang is at Tinnudir, an island off the east shore of Lake Evendim, west of the North Downs. Glorfindel has asked you to seek out his old battle-companion Erchiel who is said to be living near Lake Evendim. He has sent you first to speak to the Ranger Culang at Tinnudir, for it may be that he knows where she can be found.\n2\tTalk to Erchiel\tErchiel may be found in a glade on the north-west shore of Lake Evendim, by a stream that empties into the lake. Culang received you warmly but confessed he had not heard the name Erchiel before. He suggested it may be that she can be found in or near a strange glade on the west shore of Lake Evendim, but he warned you that the area is very dangerous.\n",
[5820]="7000B938\n1\tReturn to Nogmeldir with Glorwen's bow\030Find some sign of Glorwen amongst the giant-ruins\tThe giant-ruins of Starkhath are well to the east. Nogmeldir asked you to search the Warg-infested giant-ruins for signs of the Elven scout Glorwen.\n",
[5821]="7001757F\n1\tCollect scent-glands from the spider Luillë\tLuillë can be found in the Redhorn Lodes, north of the Claw Hollow and just west of the Foundations of Stone. Valthor has asked you to defeat the spider Luillë and bring him her scent-glands.\n2\tTalk to Valthor at the Shadowed Refuge\tValthor is at the Shadowed Refuge, east from the Redhorn Lodes. You should return to Valthor with Luillë's glands.\n",
[5822]="7006B587\n1\tDefeat a glory-seeking enemy\tAmong the enemies of Angmar is an audacious firebrand intent on slaughtering all that they can. Hunt them down and claim their bounty. Only Glory Seeking Monster Players count toward the advance of this quest.\n",
[5823]="7006B5A7\n1\tDefeat enemies of the Free People ([see journal]/5)\tSeek glory across the Ettenmoors by bringing the enemy low. The more enemies you defeat the more powerful you will become.\n2\tDefeat enemies of the Free People (total: 5)\tContinue seeking glory across the Ettenmoors by bringing the enemy low. The more enemies you defeat the more powerful you will become.\n3\tDefeat enemies of the Free People (total: 5)\tContinue seeking glory across the Ettenmoors by bringing the enemy low. The more enemies you defeat the more powerful you will become.\n4\tDefeat enemies of the Free People (total: 5)\tSeek glory across the Ettenmoors by bringing the enemy low. The more enemies you defeat the more powerful you will become.\n5\tDefeat enemies of the Free People (total: 5)\tSeek glory across the Ettenmoors by bringing the enemy low. The more enemies you defeat the more powerful you will become.\n",
[5824]="7006B586\n1\tSlaughter the Free People (total: 5)\tScour the Ettenmoors for the enemies of Angmar and eliminate them where they are found. Slaughter for the glory of Angmar!\n2\tSlaughter the Free People (total: 5)\tScour the Ettenmoors for the enemies of Angmar and eliminate them where they are found. Slaughter for the glory of Angmar!\n3\tSlaughter the Free People (total: 5)\tScour the Ettenmoors for the enemies of Angmar and eliminate them where they are found. Slaughter for the glory of Angmar!\n4\tSlaughter the Free People (total: 5)\tScour the Ettenmoors for the enemies of Angmar and eliminate them where they are found. Slaughter for the glory of Angmar!\n5\tSlaughter the Free People (total: 5)\tScour the Ettenmoors for the enemies of Angmar and eliminate them where they are found. Slaughter for the glory of Angmar!\n",
